      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ealle mæssepreostas we biddað ⁊ lærað þæt hi beorgan heom silfum wið Godes irre.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we pray and admonish all priests to guard against incurring the wrath of God.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And ealle mæssepreostas we biddað ⁊ lærað, þæt hy beorgan heom sylfum wið Godes yrre.</ab>
      </div>
